쿼리 작성: SELECT
  1.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN COALESCE(review_comment_title, '') LIKE '%!%' OR COALESCE(review_comment_message, '') LIKE '%!%' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*) AS ratio_with_exclamation
FROM order_reviews;

